SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-only WITH OCCT-exception-1.0

Topological operations: the count of the uses of the points of the data
structure stays within its array (mitcad#160). TopOpeBRepBuild_Builder::
BuildEdges counts, in an array indexed 0 to NbPoints, the interferences
that use each point, to remove the points no interference uses. One of
its four increments checked the index against NbPoints; the other three
wrote wherever an interference of kind POINT pointed, so an interference
with a wrong index (0090) overwrote the heap. An index outside the points
names no point and is not counted, as the checked increment already did.
diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_BuildEdges.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_BuildEdges.cxx
index 32de52b3..30d0341f 100644
